On Sep 28, 2012, at 12:05 PM, Víctor Pascual Cid wrote:

> Thank you very much for the quick reply.
> Could you provide a hint on how the serialization may work in this case?

Something like

REXP b = c.eval("serialize(x, NULL)");

//....

c.assign("*tmp*", b);
c.voidEval("x <- unserialize(`*tmp*`)");

Cheers,
Simon


